      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchada fe'l shaxsga qarab o'zgaradi: o'qiyMAN, o'qiySAN, o'qiyDI. Koreyschada bitta shakl hammaga: 읽어요. Kim haqida gapirayotgan suhbatdan bilinadi.",
      "compare_en": "English changes the verb for 'he/she' (reads) and uses 'am/is -ing' for now. Korean has one form for all of these: 읽어요 = 'I read / I'm reading / she reads'."
