        "audio": "2a771102d5d6.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "네, 정말 좋아해요.",
        "uz": "Ha, juda yaxshi ko'raman.",
        "en": "Yes, I really like them.",
        "audio": "5348671265f8.mp3"
